{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24501","headline":"皇甫郎中亲家翁赴任绦州宴送出城赠别 · 白居易","name":"皇甫郎中亲家翁赴任绦州宴送出城赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慕贤入室交先定，结援通家好复成。\n新妇不嫌贫活计，娇孙同慰老心情。\n洛桥歌酒今朝散，绦路风烟几日行。\n欲识离羣相恋意，爲君扶病出都城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}